  </div>
  <div class="hustle-card">
    <h3 id="delivery">2. Food and grocery delivery</h3>
    <p>DoorDash, Uber Eats, Instacart and Walmart Spark are busy across the metro. Dense pockets like Midtown, West Midtown and Buckhead mean short trips, while suburbs such as Sandy Springs, Alpharetta and Decatur tend to tip well. Afternoon thunderstorms in summer often trigger peak pay.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $15–$22/hr before gas</li><li><b>Startup:</b> Car, scooter or e-bike</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Flexible evenings</li></ul>
  </div>
